Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.84,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.38,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're dashing together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Water swirls, but I ain't\Nbacking down so long as I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.22,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare they publish this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.38,0:01:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with that picture, no less. Absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.46,0:01:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We told you to remove\Nthe D and you ignored us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.48,0:01:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't informed, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We got the pictures from Tang of CP0.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We just thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.49,0:01:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Reprint them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let this trash get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.70,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't contact the printing company!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.06,0:01:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Useless idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.40,0:02:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them, or you'll all pay the price!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.16,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That photo really excites\Nthe imagination, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll deliver every last copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Cipher Pol infiltrated the land of water,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.40,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and no one's heard a peep from them since!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.58,0:02:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,In their last transmission, they\Nsaid Big Mop's ship had arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.02,0:02:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The government won't\Nmanipulate this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.14,0:02:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,When the winds of change are whipping\Nup a storm, nothing beats the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.02,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The news never stops!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.62,0:02:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's flying full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.22,0:02:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A special report? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.46,0:02:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow, check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.84,0:02:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Emperors of the sea Kaido and Big\NMom defeated news this massive could
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:03:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,not be contained and It spread across\Nthe world like wildfire the people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.20,0:03:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,were clamoring to learn the names of\NThe three pirate captains who ended
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,the emperor's reign and the world\Ngovernment was swift in their Judgment,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.56,0:03:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,placing an exorbitant bounty on each head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.86,0:03:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three billion berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.38,0:03:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, boss. Nice, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.92,0:03:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I have got to look at this up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.84,0:03:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this part out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.62,0:03:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, boss, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.86,0:03:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's even Pizarro than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think he's running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.44,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The flower capital, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a new emperor\Nof the sea, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.76,0:03:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's no surprise who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a banquet\Nin the capital today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go tear it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.00,0:03:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just in time for us to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.14,0:03:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm about to let loose, baby. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's festival time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We're ready to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a disaster, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.10,0:04:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Add cloudier mushrooms and chrysanthemum\Nleaves, a plate of Geoise tofu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.94,0:04:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,some flower-shaped lotus\Nroots, next up, cucumber salad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We must not let any harm\Nbefall our honored guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Grind everything once,\Nheat it up and reshape it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.02,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then test it for poison three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.66,0:04:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've honed these skills over decades,\Nall in service of this wondrous day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Traditional cuisine fit for a shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please enjoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.72,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.04,0:04:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A rowdy crew won't wait two hours\Nfor food, no matter how tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.72,0:04:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A pity, since this is\Nquite the sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.74,0:04:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You've done splendid work, Chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like the festival's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Party time! Party time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's grab that food and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.74,0:05:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Chocolate bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fried noodles!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.70,0:05:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Octopus balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.64,0:05:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's candy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the greatest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.34,0:05:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.34,0:05:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Totally free!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My very first festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.12,0:05:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't decide what I want to eat next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just so much\Nawesome-looking stuff, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there! What are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.94,0:05:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called candy apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a jewel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sweet and sour and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.68,0:05:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fruit is good, but candy\Nfruit is a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, less talking, more eating, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.72,0:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's stalls with games\Nand stuff too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:06:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you guys are the festival\Nexperts, can you show me some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, bro, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've had all the food, there's\None thing you always gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.78,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now! Gum-Gum! Target! Shoot it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I never miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.52,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think that's how you play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Luffy, you can't use your hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.56,0:06:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I broke the net!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're up next!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll show you how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Two in one stroke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're a real pro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.42,0:06:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I wish I was as good as you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That sweet time doesn't\Nmake me happy, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.92,0:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks pretty happy to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.96,0:06:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock him down, Brook! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to introduce you\Nall to my jam partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.38,0:07:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano's Pitch Perfect Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you rock with the Soul\NKing, then you gotta be royalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.66,0:07:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.62,0:07:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We're serving up Brother\NOmer's favorite tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Moon Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.74,0:07:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Yachty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find something of interest. Nico Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think of my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What aren't they cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.02,0:07:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.64,0:07:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I struck a nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're funny. Mr. Tang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, this is a rather odd\Nplace for your collection. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I do hope you realize I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you might call\Nthis my secret hobby room,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and I was also confined\Nhere for quite some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.90,0:08:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Confined?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you're more\Nthan just a swordsmith.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.64,0:08:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's but a pastime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.78,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I have a good\Naptitude for it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I never cared for\Nfestivals during my reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the father of Kozuki Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.20,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Kozuki Sukiyaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.20,0:08:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shogun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Momo know you're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.00,0:08:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.91,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have a feeling my son's retainers\Nhave figured out who I am by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.44,0:09:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I'm the one responsible\Nfor the tragedy that befell this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too ashamed to tell\Nanyone that I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When I emerged from this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,barely clinging to life, Odin was\Ndead and my beloved home was in ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt such remorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought to slip my belly on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I had no choice but to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.36,0:09:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a mission to carry out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I could not fail my country again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.98,0:09:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.96,0:09:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,the land of Wano is free,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.30,0:09:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and for that I owe my deepest\Ngratitude to you and your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.36,0:09:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think they'd be very happy\Nif you told them that in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.18,0:09:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, there's something\Nelse I need to ask you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been informed that this\Ncountry has an ancient weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.30,0:09:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.20,0:10:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that it's written on\Nthe poneglyph in the kingdom of Alabasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I never imagined you'd know of\Nsuch a thing but yes it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got my voluptuous car!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know when to quit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't even captains.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.96,0:10:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If I lose to you, I'll\Nbe a walking discreet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a damn mess, and the Navy\Ndoesn't have the manpower to clean it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But it looks like you were\Nworth fighting after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.96,0:10:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't want you to\Nstart in trouble later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weak booze if I've ever tasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Should have expected that from\Na weak-ass crew like yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.19,0:11:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.11,0:11:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a warship to the land\Nof Wano. What? Real kugyu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't squeal the sakazuki\Neither, got it? Kullik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.40,0:11:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No offense, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.92,0:11:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I still like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.04,0:11:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially the way you never cut corners.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.02,0:11:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If I break some rules,\NI know you won't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.66,0:11:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm bringing you this kid's head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, up there! Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a toast, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he going to make a speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.68,0:11:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninja's pirates, minx, and samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The shogun's retainers!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.70,0:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yakuza and the people of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys really kicked some ass out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.46,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drink to that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's the king of the banquet! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm king of the banquet!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Muffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.10,0:12:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell the land of\NWano about me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it'd make me a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.94,0:12:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who defeated Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.82,0:12:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The people need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wano has been waiting\Nfor you, Momo, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my body!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.50,0:12:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.96,0:12:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm taking you out right now! Taggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.14,0:12:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks ready? Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to good food every single day!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.40,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to show them how to party!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.40,0:12:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, perhaps another bottle is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.84,0:13:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for a feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty those cups and fill them up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.60,0:13:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop till dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates know how to\Ncelebrate. I'll say that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,In all my futures, I've never\Nbeen to a banquet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, this victory, this moment shared\Nwith friends, will stay with me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.58,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here to have a\Ntoast with you, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And why come to the\Nparty in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you haven't been keeping\Nup with the news overseas, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.96,0:13:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.20,0:13:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take you out\Nwhile I still have a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.30,0:13:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wado?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The news that shocked the world came\Nas quite a surprise to Luffy as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.12,0:13:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a moment that marked the end of the
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,old regime and the beginning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.86,0:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,A shift in power left four\Ninfluential pirates in the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.76,0:14:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy the Genius Jester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.86,0:14:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Redhead Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And after his victory, Straw Hat Luthu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The four of you are the\Nnew emperors of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like they're having a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.18,0:14:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Navy didn't come here to\Ndance to your tour, little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.74,0:14:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bleed all of you dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You've turned the whole\Ndamn world upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.58,0:15:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll be taking your head\Nas a means of an apology.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Rahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.36,0:15:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.10,0:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen this country\Nsince I bid farewell to Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.56,0:15:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Momo and Hiyori must\Nbe all grown up by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.98,0:16:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And they're sneaking into Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.34,0:16:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a foreboding presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.94,0:16:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You felt it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.34,0:16:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know not what it is,\Nbut it draws closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.52,0:16:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy and the others are still\Nrecovering from their battle injuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let them know about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:17:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So Yuka are noticed too, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.56,0:17:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let the sounds\Nof the festival stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing about influence is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.54,0:17:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,when you want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it just slips away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey I only have business\Nwith Straw Hat Luffy so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just step\Naside samurai he's a
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,marine they've come for\NSir Luffy they're the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Enemy of pirates but how did one get here
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.26,0:17:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,interesting so you know\Nabout the outside world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Well I can still teach you a thing or two
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kappa style!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,River of Retribution!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're testing my patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.94,0:18:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.26,0:19:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The celestial dragons are\Nthe gods of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.32,0:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And since the land of Wano chooses\Nto live outside their rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Its people have no rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.02,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Race, we can't let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Groves of wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the power of the\Nwoods—woods fruit, a woodsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.92,0:19:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The forest is the cradle of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.16,0:19:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like the sea, it's\Nthe very essence of Logia.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.08,0:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.98,0:20:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can kill you all\Nwithout a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.36,0:20:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The government doesn't protect you\Nbecause to the rest of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.06,0:20:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak that\Nway about our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.50,0:20:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mankind has always divided itself\Nand chosen who to label as inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.76,0:20:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can think of it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.66,0:20:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacrifice of the few is what\Nguarantees the peace of the many
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.94,0:20:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Unaffiliated countries like yours have\Nno choice but to accept your suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.78,0:20:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When the rest of the world looks down on\Nyou, it reaffirms their worth as humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.64,0:20:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Discrimination creates comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.56,0:20:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how the world works!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.32,0:20:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Try and stop me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.10,0:21:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill thousands of\Nyou insects if that's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,what it takes to get destroyed on Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you say is disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.22,0:21:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the hold-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go see Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.68,0:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's come far enough, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one hell of a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He really did it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.92,0:21:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strong Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.76,0:21:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This country has suffered for 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,On this day, they celebrate a freedom\Nthey fought tooth and nail for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you spoil it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.12,0:22:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the son of Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.02,0:22:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well spoken, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.74,0:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Momonosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.60,0:22:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The heroes who saved this\Ncountry deserve their rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.76,0:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make certain they\Nhave it. The dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Black breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.26,0:22:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.44,0:22:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you must fight, do it\Naway from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not trouble my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.00,0:22:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise to\Nthem and I will keep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.54,0:22:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A pink dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of a devil\Nfruit power like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.46,0:23:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.28,0:23:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, please, step\Nback from this battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be coming up on water real soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.44,0:23:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.08,0:23:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't land there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.14,0:23:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm just\Nnot ready to see Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.54,0:23:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bet that little bastard\Nkid is still there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.10,0:23:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He picked a fight with us once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.82,0:23:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.40,0:23:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in fighting over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.14,0:24:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That power...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're kidding that's\Nred-haired shanks they've
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.04,0:24:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,got some Cape agents on\Nboard huh what a pain
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.78,0:24:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,don't worry let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.98,0:24:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,WE NEED TO HOLD STREETS BACK!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.94,0:24:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.85,0:24:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would they be targeting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.50,0:24:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do they want?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.90,0:24:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not carrying any treasure with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.74,0:24:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All we have is a Devil Fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they want stupid\Nrubber powers that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.50,0:25:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You better start taking me seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prove how tough I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.63,0:25:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.68,0:25:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.18,0:25:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Luffy. Come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.72,0:25:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.38,0:25:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stretchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.78,0:25:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.62,0:26:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.16,0:26:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.92,0:26:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a man, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.78,0:26:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Jinx, your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.74,0:26:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess all the top guys know Straw\NHat Luffy from back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.18,0:26:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of pirate do you think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.32,0:26:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard Straw Hat luffy\Nis totally out of control!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.10,0:26:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a violent monster like\Nan ape in human clothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.34,0:26:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.40,0:26:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna go, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to see Luffy yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, think about what's\Nbeen going on in our territory?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about our Jolly\NRoger getting burned, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.52,0:26:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that guy's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.12,0:26:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was Luffy's underling\Nand replaced our flag with his Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.28,0:27:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy's gonna be king of the pirates\NTake this free sticker to support him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.86,0:27:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is Shanks' territory,\Nand he's an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.12,0:27:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.64,0:27:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about no damn emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a reputation to uphold.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.24,0:27:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't just let it slide.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.90,0:27:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, that's one way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.28,0:27:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand, we'd\Njust be saying hi to a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.22,0:27:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let the Revolutionary Army\Nget away with this anymore, Akahinu.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.10,0:27:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to stomp them out, but we\Ndon't have enough troops to deploy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.72,0:27:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.63,0:27:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's become their hero, and\Nnow the whole world knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.40,0:27:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nefertari Cobra was the sole king\Nat the Reverie descended from
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.14,0:27:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the first 20 who created the\Nworld government 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.46,0:27:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,As far as symbolic victories go,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think the Revolutionary Army\Ncould have asked for a better outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.54,0:28:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hours before the assassination,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.44,0:28:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,in the land of the gods where\Nthe world nobles reside,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.60,0:28:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the Revolutionaries declared war by\Ndestroying the hoof of the Celestial Dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,a symbol of divine rulership.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.62,0:28:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Admirals Ryokugyu and Fujitora\Nled the Navy forces into battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.80,0:28:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but the enemy escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, they freed the former\Nrevolutionary Bartholomew Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,who had been enslaved by\Nthe Celestial Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.68,0:28:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, a stunning loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.94,0:28:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Must have been hard for the admirals\Nto fight in the land of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.84,0:28:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's not make excuses\Nfor them. They failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The report says Princess\NVivi is nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.92,0:28:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Went poof, around the same\Ntime as her father's murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.34,0:28:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure if the two cases are related.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.56,0:28:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.94,0:28:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta must be hurting right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.30,0:28:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,King Cobra's ship is still\Nsitting at the Red Port.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even send it home\Nthanks to all the madness going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.00,0:29:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the attempted murder of St.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.20,0:29:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.11,0:29:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we closing the case on that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.46,0:29:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, St.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.37,0:29:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Miosgaard has been accused of\Nletting the assailant escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.16,0:29:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're deliberating over the\Nmatter in the land of the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.98,0:29:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The Holy Knights have intervened\Nand it's turned into a huge mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.22,0:29:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not our problem. Let them\Nfigure it out in each.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.32,0:29:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,case the public is\Nconvinced that Sabo was the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.58,0:29:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,one pulling the strings\Nthis caused quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.74,0:29:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,stir as you might guess\Nhe's a popular man in the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.12,0:29:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,lands that were part of the eight nation
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.04,0:29:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,revolution sparks of rebellion\Nof starting fires all
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.42,0:29:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,over the world and to the\Ntraders Sabo is a hero
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.96,0:29:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they worship him like\Nsome kind of god they've
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.80,0:29:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Even started calling him\Nthe Flame Emperor. He's
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,become so popular he's\Neven overshadowed the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.08,0:29:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,revolutionary army's leader,\Nthe insurgent serpent
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon on top of all that,\NSabo's little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.40,0:30:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,is Straw Hat Luffy how\Ncute they're both emperors
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the flame emperor will strike down the old
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.96,0:30:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,regime just like his\Nbrother did in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.10,0:30:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Of pirates, this is the\Nbeginning of a new era.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.56,0:30:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What a mess picked a hell of\Na time to be fleet admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.46,0:30:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine you bastards can\Ndo your worst I won't
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.92,0:30:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,lose no matter how many of you come at me
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.94,0:30:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.48,0:31:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Beck, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're ready to go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.14,0:31:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece.
